#4471 was merged as one known issue, with one fix queued. The table is the split the desk's own cause rule makes. A row marked as not this ticket has no ticket of its own. The note under the table is a reading that is not the cause it was filed under.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

The public repo has one ticket for the parser reading and one for the hint reading. The note under the table stays on the parser ticket, because that is where those reports were filed.

